format.description:
Output format. PDF requires WeasyPrint on the server (lazy-loaded);
on hosts without it the response is `pdf_dependency_missing` /
`weasyprint_missing`.

fx_pending.description:
`true` when the FX rate could not be resolved at write time
(no manual override + no cached rate). The save still succeeds;
base mirrors are `null` until rate is backfilled.
